The Central Apprenticeship Council Rules, 1962
Definitions .-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Apprentices Act, 1961 (
52 of 1961
);
(b)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Central Apprenticeship Council;
(c)
"Council" means the Central Apprenticeship Council established under sub-section (1) of section 24 of the Act;
(d)
"Member" means a member of the Council;
(e)
"Secretary" means Secretary to the Council.
